{
  "name": "Follow-ups",
  "description": "What someone promised to do next, with an owner and a date, linked to its project and the meeting it came from.",
  "position": 2,
  "agentPrompts": [
    {
      "key": "my-followups",
      "label": {
        "en": "What do I still owe this week?",
        "zh-CN": "我这周还欠哪些跟进"
      },
      "body": {
        "en": "Read the `busa-dealflow` skill in this folder and follow it. List the open follow-ups whose owner is me, overdue first, then due this week, with the project and the meeting each came from. Do not change anything.",
        "zh-CN": "先阅读本文件夹里的 `busa-dealflow` Skill，按它的规则做。列出负责人是我的未完成待跟进：先列逾期的，再列本周到期的，带上项目和来源会议。不要修改任何记录。"
      },
      "intent": "read-only"
    },
    {
      "key": "close-followup",
      "label": {
        "en": "Mark a follow-up done and note the outcome",
        "zh-CN": "把一条跟进标记完成并写结果"
      },
      "body": {
        "en": "Read the `busa-dealflow` skill in this folder and follow it. Mark the follow-up I describe as done today and write its outcome in Notes. If the outcome changes the project's next step, update the project too.",
        "zh-CN": "先阅读本文件夹里的 `busa-dealflow` Skill，按它的规则做。把我说的这条跟进标记为今天完成，在备注里写结果。如果结果改变了项目的下一步，同时更新项目。"
      },
      "intent": "change"
    },
    {
      "key": "chase-overdue",
      "label": {
        "en": "Draft reminders for overdue follow-ups",
        "zh-CN": "给逾期的跟进起草提醒"
      },
      "body": {
        "en": "Read the `busa-dealflow` skill in this folder and follow it. For every overdue follow-up, draft a one-line reminder to its owner naming the project and what was promised. Reply in chat; do not send anything or change records.",
        "zh-CN": "先阅读本文件夹里的 `busa-dealflow` Skill，按它的规则做。为每条逾期的待跟进给负责人起草一句提醒，写明项目和当时答应的事。直接回复在对话里，不要发送，也不要改记录。"
      },
      "intent": "read-only"
    }
  ],
